IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `cdr-rules`

-- Civil Dispute Resolution Act 2011 (Cth) — the encoder's tests.

§ `Tests`

`fca` MEANS `the Federal Court of Australia`
`ordinary` MEANS `ordinary civil proceedings`

GIVEN s IS A `My side`, ct IS A `Court`, k IS A `Kind of proceedings`, part IS A BOOLEAN, copy IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Dispute case`
`as` s `in` ct `of kind` k `partly` part `given a copy` copy MEANS
    `Dispute case` OF s, ct, TRUE, k, part, Date 3 2 2026, copy, Date 2 3 2026

#ASSERT `I must file` (`as` `the applicant` `in` `fca` `of kind` `ordinary` `partly` FALSE `given a copy` FALSE)
#ASSERT `the last day to file for` (`as` `the applicant` `in` `fca` `of kind` `ordinary` `partly` FALSE `given a copy` FALSE) EQUALS JUST (Date 3 2 2026)
#ASSERT `I must file` (`as` `the applicant` `in` `the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2)` `of kind` `ordinary` `partly` FALSE `given a copy` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`I must file` (`as` `the applicant` `in` `another court` `of kind` `ordinary` `partly` FALSE `given a copy` FALSE))
-- s 7(1): before the hearing date of 2 March 2026.
#ASSERT `the last day to file for` (`as` `the respondent` `in` `fca` `of kind` `ordinary` `partly` FALSE `given a copy` TRUE) EQUALS JUST (Date 1 3 2026)
#ASSERT NOT (`I must file` (`as` `the respondent` `in` `fca` `of kind` `ordinary` `partly` FALSE `given a copy` FALSE))
-- s 6(3)-(4)
#ASSERT NOT (`I must file` (`as` `the applicant` `in` `fca` `of kind` `ex parte` `partly` FALSE `given a copy` FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`I must file` (`as` `the applicant` `in` `fca` `of kind` `under a listed Act, such as the Fair Work, Family Law or Migration Act` `partly` FALSE `given a copy` FALSE))
#ASSERT `I must file` (`as` `the applicant` `in` `fca` `of kind` `under a listed Act, such as the Fair Work, Family Law or Migration Act` `partly` TRUE `given a copy` FALSE)
#ASSERT `it may leave out excluded parts` (`as` `the applicant` `in` `fca` `of kind` `under a listed Act, such as the Fair Work, Family Law or Migration Act` `partly` TRUE `given a copy` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`it may leave out excluded parts` (`as` `the applicant` `in` `fca` `of kind` `ordinary` `partly` FALSE `given a copy` FALSE))
#ASSERT `the last day to file for` (`as` `the applicant` `in` `fca` `of kind` `in the appellate jurisdiction` `partly` FALSE `given a copy` FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- not civil
#ASSERT NOT (`I must file` (`Dispute case` OF `the applicant`, `fca`, FALSE, `ordinary`, FALSE, Date 3 2 2026, FALSE, Date 2 3 2026))
-- ss 10-12
#ASSERT NOT ((`the dispute position for` (`as` `the applicant` `in` `fca` `of kind` `ordinary` `partly` FALSE `given a copy` FALSE))'s `not filing invalidates the proceedings`)
#ASSERT `the court may weigh it` (`as` `the applicant` `in` `fca` `of kind` `ordinary` `partly` FALSE `given a copy` FALSE)
